{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_CANTP_SECTION_6_Requirements_Tracing","src":"manifest","doc":"SWS_CANTransportLayer","page":21,"text":"6 Requirements Tracing\nThe following tables reference the requirements specified in [7] and [8] and links to the\nfulfillment of these. Please note that if column “Satisfied by” is empty for a specific\nrequirement this means that this requirement is not fulfilled by this document.\nRequirement\nDescription\nSatisfied by\n[RS_Ids_00810]\nBasic SW security events\n[SWS_CanTp_00371] [SWS_CanTp_00372]\n[SWS_CanTp_00373] [SWS_CanTp_00374]\n[SWS_CanTp_00375] [SWS_CanTp_00376]\n[SWS_CanTp_00377] [SWS_CanTp_00378]\n[SWS_CanTp_00379] [SWS_CanTp_00380]\n[SWS_CanTp_00381] [SWS_CanTp_00382]\n[SWS_CanTp_00383]\n[SRS_BSW_00101]\nThe Basic Software Module shall be\nable to initialize variables and\nhardware in a separate initialization\nfunction\n[SWS_CanTp_00208]\n[SRS_BSW_00159]\nAll modules of the AUTOSAR Basic\nSoftware shall support a tool based\nconfiguration\n[SWS_CanTp_00146]\n[SRS_BSW_00167]\nAll AUTOSAR Basic Software\nModules shall provide configuration\nrules and constraints to enable\nplausibility checks\n[SWS_CanTp_00147]\n[SRS_BSW_00336]\nBasic SW module shall be able to\nshutdown\n[SWS_CanTp_00010]\n[SRS_BSW_00339]\nReporting of production relevant error\nstatus\n[SWS_CanTp_00008]\n[SRS_BSW_00353]\nAll integer type definitions of target\nand compiler specific scope shall be\nplaced and organized in a single type\nheader\n[SWS_CanTp_00002]\n[SRS_BSW_00358]\nThe return type of init() functions\nimplemented by AUTOSAR Basic\nSoftware Modules shall be void\n[SWS_CanTp_00208]\n[SRS_BSW_00373]\nThe main processing function of each\nAUTOSAR Basic Software Module\nshall be named according the defined\nconvention\n[SWS_CanTp_00164]\n[SRS_BSW_00406]\nAPI handling in uninitialized state\n[SWS_CanTp_00161]\n[SRS_BSW_00414]\nInit functions shall have a pointer to a\nconfiguration structure as single\nparameter\n[SWS_CanTp_00208]\n[SRS_BSW_00424]\nBSW module main processing\nfunctions shall not be allowed to enter\na wait state\n[SWS_CanTp_00164]\n[SRS_Can_01065]\nThe AUTOSAR CAN Transport Layer\nshall be based on ISO 15765-2 and\n15765-4 specificat…","caption":"6 Requirements Tracing","sha":null,"series":[{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_CANTP_SECTION_6_Requirements_Tracing","releases":["R23-11"],"page":21,"hash":"a8477c0be60231ae","caption":"","screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/3b2f8e0e53d0/page_21.webp"},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_CANTP_SECTION_6_Requirements_Tracing","releases":["R24-11"],"page":21,"hash":"afad46b9eab67f22","caption":"","screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/7334d633b02c/page_21.webp"},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_CANTP_SECTION_6_Requirements_Tracing","releases":["R25-11"],"page":21,"hash":"b86197d24fe14601","caption":"","screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/2e011fea9c12/page_21.webp"}],"releases":["R23-11","R24-11","R25-11"],"screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/2e011fea9c12/page_21.webp","trel":"R25-11","tstat":"section","kind":"snippet","platform":"classic","targets":[{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.98,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Explizite Erwähnung von SWS_CanTp_00208 im Text des Dokuments AUTOSAR_CP_SWS_CANTransportLayer.pdf.","rel":["R23-11","R24-11","R25-11"],"id":"SWS_CanTp_00208"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Direktzitat [RS_Ids_00810] im Text von SWS_CANTransportLayer.","rel":["R25-11"],"id":"RS_Ids_00810"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Direktzitat [SWS_CanTp_00002] im Text von SWS_CANTransportLayer.","rel":["R25-11"],"id":"SWS_CanTp_00002"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Direktzitat [SWS_CanTp_00008] im Text von SWS_CANTransportLayer.","rel":["R25-11"],"id":"SWS_CanTp_00008"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Direktzitat [SWS_CanTp_00010] im Text von SWS_CANTransportLayer.","rel":["R25-11"],"id":"SWS